01 — Product Requirements Document (PRD)
ZARA — Personal Pakistani AI Voice Assistant
1. Project Overview
Product Name: ZARA (Personal AI Voice Assistant)
Product Type: Full-stack AI-powered voice assistant — Browser Web App + Windows Desktop Companion
Primary Language: Pakistani Urdu (Roman Urdu + Urdu script support)
AI Provider: Google Gemini API
Target User: Single personal user (the owner/developer)
2. Purpose & Goals
#	Goal
G1	ZARA ek always-ready personal AI assistant ho jo natural Pakistani Urdu mein baat kare
G2	"Hello ZARA" bolne par automatically activate ho — bina kisi button ke
G3	Realistic, human-like Pakistani Urdu voice mein jawab de
G4	Apni distinct personality, emotions aur confidence rakhti ho
G5	Browser aur Windows dono par simultaneously kaam kare
G6	Google AI Studio band hone ke baad bhi standalone chale
G7	WhatsApp messaging ka UI/flow ready ho (real integration baad mein)
G8	User ki preferences aur context yaad rakhe
3. Target Users & Roles
Role	Description
Owner (User)	Sirf ek user — ZARA ka maalik jo usse daily use karta hai
(No admin panel, no multi-user system)	ZARA ek personal assistant hai, public app nahi
