6. ZARA States (System-Wide)
code
Code
INITIALIZING → STANDBY → LISTENING → WAKE_WORD_DETECTED → PROCESSING → SPEAKING → LISTENING
                                                                              ↓
                                                                        INTERRUPTED → LISTENING
STANDBY → MUTED → STANDBY
Any State → RECONNECTING → previous state
Any State → ERROR → recovery attempt
