02 — Technical Requirements Document (TRD)
ZARA — Personal Pakistani AI Voice Assistant
1. Technology Stack
Layer	Technology	Reason
Frontend	React 18 + TypeScript + Vite	Fast, type-safe, AI Studio compatible
Styling	Tailwind CSS + custom CSS variables	Rapid UI, design token system
State Management	Zustand	Lightweight, perfect for real-time state
Desktop App	Electron (wraps the React app)	Windows companion, system tray, auto-start
Backend	Node.js + TypeScript (Express)	API proxy, secret management, websocket
Real-time Comms	WebSocket (ws library)	Low-latency voice state updates
Database	Supabase (PostgreSQL)	Conversation history, memory, settings
AI Provider	Google Gemini API	Text, audio, multimodal
Wake Word	Porcupine (Picovoice) browser/node SDK	Local, offline wake-word detection
Speech Recognition	Web Speech API (browser) + Gemini audio	Fallback chain
TTS	Gemini TTS / Google Cloud TTS	Pakistani Urdu voice
Hosting (Browser)	Cloudflare Workers & Pages	From GitHub, no Vercel
Source Control	GitHub	AI Studio → Export to GitHub
